<title>USA: Banc One may tap corporate debt market.</title>
<headline>Banc One may tap corporate debt market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Corp is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a three-part $750 million debt offering, syndicate sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to include a three-year issue with price talk seen at +30 basis points, a five-year issue in the area of +40 basis points and a seven-year maturity at +50 basis points, syndicate sources said.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the offering.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
